  <name>ESP32S31_RADIO</name>
  <series>ESP32-S31</series>
  <version>0.1</version>
  <description>
    Recovered ESP32-S31 radio clock, reset and power subset. Unknown fields are
    omitted; OPAQUE names describe instruction-level evidence without assigning
    an unproven hardware meaning.
  </description>
